{{also|heu|HEU}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gem-pro|*hawją}}. Cognate with {{cog|non|hey}} ({{cog|da|hø}}) and {{cog|got|𐌷𐌰𐍅𐌹}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/hɔɪ̯/|[hɔɪ̯]}}
* {{audio|de|De-Heu.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|de|ɔɪ̯|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n,(e)s.sg}}

# [[hay]]
#: {{uxi|de|das '''Heu''' trocknen|to make '''hay'''}}
#: {{uxi|de|eine Stecknadel im '''Heu'''haufen suchen|to look for a needle in a '''hay'''stack}}
# {{lb|de|colloquial}} plentiful money
# {{lb|de|slang}} [[marijuana]]

